Amazon Lily is a country of women only. Men are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:42.840
not allowed on the island – except for Luffy now,&nbsp;
of course – and the warrior women will literally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:49.860
kill any man who intrudes on their sacred island.&nbsp;
So, hmm, let’s see we have a heartbroken queen who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:55.200
left her kingdom possibly after her lover was&nbsp;
killed. Kinda makes sense to me that she would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.200 --> 00:06:01.260
form a new kingdom where she would literally&nbsp;
never have to see another man ever again.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:12.960
And even if Lily wasn’t in love with Joy Boy, it&nbsp;
could have been another man who broke her heart&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:18.180
or betrayed her, and there is one character in&nbsp;
particular who we’ll discuss in just a moment.

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:22.260
But back to Amazon Lily, there&nbsp;
is also the famous love sickness,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:27.180
like we see with Boa Hancock, who is literally&nbsp;
dying because she has fallen in love with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:31.560
Luffy ch 521-522]. And this sickness has&nbsp;
also affected other rulers of Amazon Lily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:36.900
so the deadly illness might have&nbsp;
started with Lily 800 years ago.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:42.240
One Japanese theory I’ve seen is&nbsp;
actually so crazy I need to share&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:48.180
it with you quickly. Because it connects&nbsp;
Crocodile and Ivankov and Lily. You see,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:52.860
some in the Japanese community have wondered&nbsp;
how Amazon Lily sustained their population&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:58.320
over time. We know that sometimes women&nbsp;
go out to get pregnant and then they come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:02.340
home to have the children, but what if&nbsp;
the kingdom didn’t start out like that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:08.280
but they actually used the hormone fruit to change&nbsp;
people from men into women, just like we saw the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:15.960
revolutionary army’s Ivankov do in impel down.&nbsp;
This would certainly lend more credibility to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:21.000
the fun Crocodile was originally a woman theory,&nbsp;
that we have discussed on this channel before.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:28.260
But anyways, with all this speculation about&nbsp;
the distant past, let’s bring this discussion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:33.180
back to the present chapter. We get to&nbsp;
see Crocodile interact with the Gorosei,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:38.280
and he asks them if they knew where Lily went.&nbsp;
The Gorosei reply that they do not – *coughs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:44.100
liars – but if there is anyone in Mary Geoise&nbsp;
who does know about Lily, it would have to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:49.320
the secret ruler of the world, Imu. And ever since&nbsp;
they were first introduced we have believed that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:55.260
Imu has been around since the void century. Why&nbsp;
is this??? Umm, well, I guess because they just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.260 --> 00:08:00.120
look like a 800 plus year old dude – or woman,&nbsp;
I mean we don’t even know if they are a man or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:05.400
woman yet. But that is beside the point because&nbsp;
there are more hints that Imu knows about Lily.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:10.860
And that’s because for the first&nbsp;
time, Imu makes an appearance and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:17.340
FINALLY speaks. Of course it is only a single&nbsp;
world, but it is vitally important. They say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:23.100
“Lily” right before the chapter ends.&nbsp;
And at this point my mind is going a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:27.180
thousand different directions. Not only&nbsp;
are we introduced to a super important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:32.280
character from the void century, but we also&nbsp;
learn that they seem to be important to Imu.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:44.940
So just like we explored the possibilities with&nbsp;
Lily and Joy Boy, let’s discuss the potential&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:51.120
hateful, heartbreaking, and wholesome relationship&nbsp;
between Lily and Imu. And make sure to subscribe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:55.560
to the channel because I promise not to break&nbsp;
your heart when it comes to one piece videos.

00:09:55.560 --> 00:10:02.520
And just like with Joy Boy, it is possible&nbsp;
that Lily and Imu were in love. And there is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:07.800
some evidence to support this. I mean just the&nbsp;
fact that the very first words we ever hear from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:19.200
Imu is Lily’s name is pretty significant. Plus in&nbsp;
chapter 907, when we see Imu for the first time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:23.640
they have cut up a bunch of pictures&nbsp;
