00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:34.380
possibly mean that if Vivi is a descendant of&nbsp;
Lily, they share the same last name after all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:40.620
then maybe Imu really cares about or wants to meet&nbsp;
