AND enlightenment. So we have Lily who was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:24.180
the former queen of Alabasta, and Imu, who&nbsp;
is possibly immortal and is “enlightened” as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:31.140
the secret ruler of the world. By the way Imu in&nbsp;
reverse makes Umi, which means water in Japanese.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:36.000
So if you haven’t yet connected the dots,&nbsp;
what if Lily was reborn as Imu when they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:41.280
became the secret ruler of the world.&nbsp;
You can call me crazy, but it fits with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:46.260
what we know about Imu AND with everything&nbsp;
else we’ve discussed so far in this video.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:50.700
If Lily is Imu, she could still&nbsp;
have been in love with Joy Boy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:55.560
especially because she kept what we&nbsp;
assume is Joy Boy’s hat in this big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:55.560 --> 00:13:00.840
freezing vault. Plus Imu is kept secret&nbsp;
from basically the entire world and no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:05.160
one seems to know what happened to Lily&nbsp;
after she left Alabasta after the War.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:09.420
Wow, that is really starting to make a lot of&nbsp;
sense to me right now. But we’ll have one more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:14.936
EVEN MORE INSANE theory for Lily at the end of&nbsp;
this video, but for now let’s look at this chapter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:14.936 --> 00:13:21.360
for the unfortunate king Cobra. Because while&nbsp;
Cobra is questioning the Gorosei, this is when Imu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:28.800
shows up. And while we don’t know what happened&nbsp;
in this scene, somehow Cobra ends up dead. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:39.660
