00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:19.920
Truthfully, it is also possible that Sabo&nbsp;
didn’t see Imu, especially because it has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:24.540
been about a month since this happened at the&nbsp;
