00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:29.040
this island [show Lulusia], that attack was&nbsp;
not specifically meant to take him out, since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:33.960
the Gorosei basically said they had already&nbsp;
planned to take out that kingdom. And honestly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:38.280
