00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:50.280
But with all of this talk about Lily and Imu,&nbsp;
this absolutely has to mean that Vivi is going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:56.160
to be a super important character for the endgame&nbsp;
of the story. We know she is a descendant of Lily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:56.160 --> 00:15:00.180
so it makes a lot of sense that she&nbsp;
would eventually learn all about her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:04.260
ancient ancestor. Plus she is going to be&nbsp;
reunited with the straw hats very soon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:07.740
since she is on a blimp headed&nbsp;
toward Egghead Island right now.

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:13.320
And speaking of the end game, let’s discuss a few&nbsp;
final possibilities for what happened to Lily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:18.960
including a theory that could completely&nbsp;
change the final war of the story. First, Lily&nbsp;&nbsp;

