could have simply been killed by the World&nbsp;
Government. That is definitely a possibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:28.080
here. Second, she could have been the one to&nbsp;
travel to Wano and have the poneglyphs made.

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:32.880
But speaking of Wano there is actually&nbsp;
one other named character that we know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:37.860
about from the Void Century. In&nbsp;
chapter 964, we meet this woman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

