possibilities here that make some sense.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.980
You see, remember that when Roger reached&nbsp;
Laugh Tale and learned the true history,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:46.200
he knew that he was too early to really use&nbsp;
whatever he found on the island to change the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:51.000
world. And while we have assumed that he was&nbsp;
waiting for Joy Boy to reappear – which has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:56.400
now happened with Luffy – there could actually&nbsp;
be more to this prophecy. Because what if along&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:01.740
with Luffy’s awakening, someone else from&nbsp;
the Void Century was sent forward to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:07.080
the new Joy Boy not make the same mistakes&nbsp;
that the Ancient Kingdom did. Specifically,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:13.680
I’m saying what if Lily was sent forward to help&nbsp;
Luffy in the fight against the world government.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:20.280
And while we don’t know if she has any devil&nbsp;
fruit powers, we have learned in Egghead island&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:25.800
that the ancient kingdom had highly advanced&nbsp;
technology. So what if Lily if coming to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:30.960
the straw hats use some hidden technology,&nbsp;
or to counteract some hidden weapon that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:34.560
the World Government has [show lasers that&nbsp;
destroyed Lulusia]. Or another possibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:40.140
is that Lily is the ancient weapon Uranus, and&nbsp;
she was sent forward to help win the final war.

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:44.280
And of course all of this is speculation,&nbsp;
and if Lily was sent forward that could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:49.440
mean others from the Void Century could show up&nbsp;
as well, but I do think this is a possibility,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:53.460
and one that could make for&nbsp;
an even more hyped final war.

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:59.280
And since we are talking about characters showing&nbsp;
up from the void century, here’s one more bonus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:03.840
theory, inspired by reddit user Flidan. The&nbsp;
theory is basically about what if people from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:07.680
the void century were turned into stone by the&nbsp;
Mero Mero no mi [show Boa using love beam] and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:12.240
they are waiting to be revived for the&nbsp;
final war. And while the previous user of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:16.980
the Mero Mero no mi definitely died and wouldn’t&nbsp;
be able to revive the statues themselves, it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:21.840
possible that there is some other way to revive&nbsp;
those statues, similar to what they do in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:28.860
anime Dr. Stone. Maybe there is some sake, like&nbsp;
Bink’s Sake that has been aging for 800 years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:33.240
and when it is finally ready it can be used&nbsp;
to revive the people from the void century.

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:38.280
But whatever happened to Lily, and whether we&nbsp;
will see her again, she is definitely a part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:43.020
of the important information we absolutely have&nbsp;
to learn about the Void Century before the final&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:48.720
war. Because one thing we do know is that the&nbsp;
World Government won this battle 800 years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:53.400
and it is going to be a massive challenge for&nbsp;
the straw hats to take them down this time. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:53.400 --> 00:19:00.060
if you want to learn all about the insane&nbsp;
new group of characters who could possibly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:04.260
be the straw hats final opponents,&nbsp;
you can watch this video right here.

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.640
Shanks for watching.

